## Quick Reference: Headers

| Header | When to Use | Value |
|--------|-------------|-------|
| `X-Tenant-ID` | All tenant endpoints (not SA) | `my_test_clinic` |
| `Authorization` | All authenticated endpoints | `Bearer <token>` |
| `X-CSRF-TOKEN` | All POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE on tenant | From `/api/auth/csrf-token` |
| `Content-Type` | All POST/PUT/PATCH with body | `application/json` |

