## Test Order Tips

1. **Always run SA Login (T01) first** — you need the SA token
2. **Create tenant (T02) once** — note down the password!
3. **Login + CSRF before writes** — T13 then T14 before any POST/PUT
4. **Switch to Provider for prescriptions/notes** — T28 before T29–T34
5. **Change Password last** — T51 invalidates your current credentials
